# textdomain: vl_tridents
Trident=Ljoster
Water element=Vasselement

Tridents are great in melee combat, as they have an increased reach. They can also be thrown.=Ljoster er bra i nærkamp, då dei har auka rekkjevidde.

To throw a trident, hold it in your hand, then hold use (rightclick) in the air.=For å kasta eit ljoster, hald det i handa. Hald deretter bruk (høgreklikk) i lufta.
